From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andres Ricardo Perez <andresrperez@chromium.org>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:49:35 -0700
Subject: [Canvas2d] Inline Canvas2DRecorderContext::DrawInternal into Draw

DrawInternal() was originally split out of Draw() in crrev.com/c/2842150
so unresolved filter draws could be deferred via PostDeferrableAction
during [NoAllocDirectCall] V8 Fast API calls. PostDeferrableAction was
removed in crrev.com/c/5471803, and crrev.com/c/8551394 moved filter
resolution to the beginning of Draw() before acquiring the paint canvas.

Since Draw() is the sole caller of DrawInternal() and paint_canvas is
now always non-null at that point, fold DrawInternal() directly into
Draw().

Bug: 568831763
Change-Id: I0ab6a45daf2fab2f45ccf2b6fb3c519282a96a1c
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8546974
Commit-Queue: Andres Ricardo Perez Rojas <andresrperez@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Justin Novosad <junov@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1720098}

